    sd:notes "Confirmed by viewing: 'Professional Learning - Sponsor list' [sic, actually the Sponsor Worklist screen] with Type/District-or-Sponsor/District-Sponsor-name/Application-number/Status filters, Search/Clear buttons, and a persistent admin tab bar: Sponsor Worklist | Program Worklist | Sponsor List | Program List | Category/Program description | Coupons and Payments | Email Sponsors. The 'Category/Program description' and 'Email Sponsors' tabs match Business-Specification-only capabilities modeled below (plrn:Req_28_BizSpec_ProgramCategoryMaintenance / ProgramDescriptionsAdmin / MassEmailSponsors); 'Coupons and Payments' matches nothing anywhere in this FDD's own text — see Question_CouponsAndPaymentsTabUndocumented." ;
    sd:definedIn plrn:Fdd28Doc .

plrn:Wireframe2Doc a sd:SourceDocument ; sd:docType "wireframe" ;
    sd:section "abox/mied-v3/fdd-review/28-professional-learning-processing/wireframes/wireframe-02-review-sponsor-application.png" ;
    sd:notes "Confirmed by viewing: 'Review Sponsor Application' — full submitted-application detail (School/Organization name, Address, Authorized Representative certification, submitter Name/Title/Email/Submitted Date), an Action dropdown (Comment/Submit/Cancel controls visible) and a Comment History panel showing two prior dated entries. Directly corroborates 28.1.1 (view in view mode), 28.1.3 (Action options), and 28.1.5 (comments + comment history)." ;
    sd:definedIn plrn:Fdd28Doc .

plrn:Wireframe7Doc a sd:SourceDocument ; sd:docType "wireframe" ;
